The only method for infinite wishes that I know of is Slashem's Gypsies.
Build up a huge debt with them by 'gambling', and then get your cards 
read.Every time you go throught the entire pack of cards, one of the 
cards (can't remember which one at the moment) grants a wish!

Of course there are other less pleasant effects like losing wisdom, 
getting touch of death'ed, getting punished etc, but all of these can be 
dealt with.
I remember abusing this for many useless trinkets once.I recall that the 
worst effect was the 'getting punished' one, which could be dealt with 
in many ways.
I locked a nymph in a room on a no-teleport level for repeated 
ball-and-chain removal, ISTR...

Quite an overpowered abuse, but usually by the time you find a gypsy you 
dont need the wishes (they started appearing for me at about level 50 or so)

